{
    "title": "Empower: Advance & Credit",
    "description": "Need extra cash to make it to your next paycheck? Empower\u2019s got your back. Get an Advance of up to $300 instantly.* Say goodbye to overdraft fees and stressing about money. No credit score or security deposit to qualify.\r\n\r\nGET AN INSTANT ADVANCE OF $10 TO $300\r\nTight on cash and tired of asking friends to cover you? Empower will float you anywhere from $10 to $300 when you need it most. Instant delivery available. No interest, no late fees, no credit checks. Just pay us back when you get your next paycheck.\r\n\r\nAn Advance is NOT a personal loan:\r\n\u2014 No mandatory minimum or maximum repayment timeframe\r\n\u2014 No interest (0% APR)\r\n\u2014 Example: If you accept a $50 instant Advance to your external account for a $3 instant delivery fee, then your total repayment amount will be $53.\r\n\r\nBUILD BETTER CREDIT HISTORY WITH THRIVE^\r\nCredit score holding you back? Empower Thrive is the chance you\u2019ve been waiting for. A flexible line of credit that helps you build the credit history you need to reach those big financial goals. All credit scores welcome and no money down.\r\n\r\n\u2014 Start with a $200, $250, or $400 credit limit\r\n\u2014 Repay it your way\r\n\u2014 Enjoy limit increases up to $1,000 over time**\r\n\u2014 Build good credit history\r\n\r\nSTART SAVING FOR THE FUTURE WITH AUTOMATIC SAVINGS\r\nMake investing in your future easier than ever with AutoSave. After you set your savings goal, Empower will monitor your income and spending habits to know when and how much you can afford to save. All you have to do is sit back and watch your savings grow.\r\n\r\nKEEP TABS ON YOUR CREDIT SCORE\r\nWatch your hard work pay off. We\u2019ll give you monthly score updates and helpful tips to improve your score. Credit scores are complicated enough. We\u2019ll help you understand it.\r\n\r\nGET FAST SERVICE\r\nWe\u2019ve got our A team on standby to handle your questions over the phone or live chat Monday-Friday from 6 AM \u2013 6 PM PT. (We\u2019ve got email too if that\u2019s more your jam.)\r\n\r\n\u2013\r\nEmpower is a financial technology company, not a bank. Banking services provided by nbkc bank, Member FDIC.\r\n\r\nEmpower offers a 14-day trial for first-time customers only. Once the trial concludes, Empower charges an auto-recurring $8/month subscription fee. If you do not wish to pay the subscription fee, you must cancel your subscription before the end of your trial. If you are a returning customer, you will be charged the $8 fee immediately upon resubscribing. Cancel any time by visiting \u201cBilling\u201d in the mobile app or contacting help@empower.me.\r\n\r\nBy downloading/using the app you agree to our Privacy Policy (https://empower.me/privacy).\r\n\r\n* Not everyone will qualify for an Advance. Offer amounts range from $10 - $300. As of 3/31/2024, the average offer amount is $145. Instant delivery is optional, and fees may apply. See Empower\u2019s Terms for instant delivery fee amounts.\r\n\r\n^ Empower Thrive provided by FinWise Bank, Member FDIC. Subject to credit approval. We report your payments to the credit bureaus. Failure to make on-time payments may result in negative reporting. Instant delivery is optional, and fees may apply. \r\n\r\n**To be eligible for a credit limit increase, you must successfully pay at least your minimum payment by the due date.\r\n\r\nEmpower Finance, Inc.\r\n650 California Street, Floor 7\r\nSan Francisco, California 94108",
    "descriptionHTML": "Need extra cash to make it to your next paycheck? Empower\u2019s got your back. Get an Advance of up to $300 instantly.* Say goodbye to overdraft fees and stressing about money. No credit score or security deposit to qualify.<br><br>GET AN INSTANT ADVANCE OF $10 TO $300<br>Tight on cash and tired of asking friends to cover you? Empower will float you anywhere from $10 to $300 when you need it most. Instant delivery available. No interest, no late fees, no credit checks. Just pay us back when you get your next paycheck.<br><br>An Advance is NOT a personal loan:<br>\u2014 No mandatory minimum or maximum repayment timeframe<br>\u2014 No interest (0% APR)<br>\u2014 Example: If you accept a $50 instant Advance to your external account for a $3 instant delivery fee, then your total repayment amount will be $53.<br><br>BUILD BETTER CREDIT HISTORY WITH THRIVE^<br>Credit score holding you back? Empower Thrive is the chance you\u2019ve been waiting for. A flexible line of credit that helps you build the credit history you need to reach those big financial goals. All credit scores welcome and no money down.<br><br>\u2014 Start with a $200, $250, or $400 credit limit<br>\u2014 Repay it your way<br>\u2014 Enjoy limit increases up to $1,000 over time**<br>\u2014 Build good credit history<br><br>START SAVING FOR THE FUTURE WITH AUTOMATIC SAVINGS<br>Make investing in your future easier than ever with AutoSave. After you set your savings goal, Empower will monitor your income and spending habits to know when and how much you can afford to save. All you have to do is sit back and watch your savings grow.<br><br>KEEP TABS ON YOUR CREDIT SCORE<br>Watch your hard work pay off. We\u2019ll give you monthly score updates and helpful tips to improve your score. Credit scores are complicated enough. We\u2019ll help you understand it.<br><br>GET FAST SERVICE<br>We\u2019ve got our A team on standby to handle your questions over the phone or live chat Monday-Friday from 6 AM \u2013 6 PM PT. (We\u2019ve got email too if that\u2019s more your jam.)<br><br>\u2013<br>Empower is a financial technology company, not a bank. Banking services provided by nbkc bank, Member FDIC.<br><br>Empower offers a 14-day trial for first-time customers only. Once the trial concludes, Empower charges an auto-recurring $8/month subscription fee. If you do not wish to pay the subscription fee, you must cancel your subscription before the end of your trial. If you are a returning customer, you will be charged the $8 fee immediately upon resubscribing. Cancel any time by visiting \u201cBilling\u201d in the mobile app or contacting help@empower.me.<br><br>By downloading/using the app you agree to our Privacy Policy (https://empower.me/privacy).<br><br>* Not everyone will qualify for an Advance. Offer amounts range from $10 - $300. As of 3/31/2024, the average offer amount is $145. Instant delivery is optional, and fees may apply. See Empower\u2019s Terms for instant delivery fee amounts.<br><br>^ Empower Thrive provided by FinWise Bank, Member FDIC. Subject to credit approval. We report your payments to the credit bureaus. Failure to make on-time payments may result in negative reporting. Instant delivery is optional, and fees may apply. <br><br>**To be eligible for a credit limit increase, you must successfully pay at least your minimum payment by the due date.<br><br>Empower Finance, Inc.<br>650 California Street, Floor 7<br>San Francisco, California 94108",
